#: ../../tools/nasa_donki_tools.rst:65 2a621cc42a394269836935d06ba206e7
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search NASA DONKI for Geomagnetic Storm (GST) events. "
"Returns storm observations including Kp index values (measure of "
"geomagnetic disturbance: 5=minor storm, 6=moderate, 7=strong, 8=severe, "
"9=extreme). Geomagnetic storms can cause aurora displays, GPS "
"disruptions, power grid problems, and satellite drag. No API key "
"required."
msgstr ""

