msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/nasa_donki_tools.rst:200 fb1c633a2238451ba7bcf18db4fe5bac
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search NASA DONKI for Solar Flare (FLR) events. Returns "
"flare observations including class (C/M/X), begin/peak/end times, source "
"location, and active region. Solar flares are classified by X-ray peak "
"brightness: C-class (small), M-class (medium, can cause brief radio "
"blackouts), X-class (major, can cause global radio blackouts). No API key"
" required."
msgstr ""

